 "M55": {
  "desc": "D10a：縫寬奇數不再拒絕(改成只擋負數)",
  "verdict": "retired",
  "why": "GEO-122 / GEO-125(commit bc87d02,2026-09-18)刪除奇數縫寬拒絕:apply_grid_line 的 `p_gap % 2 != 0` 檢查已移除(只剩一行過期註解),公理層 D10a「gap 為奇數不拒絕」,縫中心線取下界(錨點在 current_geometry.c:1495 `def->anchor + k*T + def->panel + def->gap / 2`,該公式仍由 M53 變異)。被變異的拒絕已不屬於產品。",
  "date": "2026-10-21",
  "source_file": "current_geometry.c",
  "mutant_sha256": "e57f384a286517d7218b7fd468309a6b593cce413ac83f4c56f5ef98a07df891",
  "record_sha256": "a9352bd30e18b331c63debe78a9dd2672738bff06ef3fe39d6087e93e6a8aafb"
 },
 "M56": {
  "desc": "I23：I23(b) 不再檢查被錨定的索引是否仍推導得出",
  "verdict": "equivalent",
  "why": "等價變異(GEO-173 實證,更正 GEO-100 的舊結論):world_validate_derived 只在 reference_rebuild 成功後才跑,而 reference_rebuild → reference_place_geometry 對每個 AT_GRID 角材已先跑同一個 grid_anchor_line_coord(同 grids/count/grid/placement/axis/index/has_band/band;boundary 若為自帶 rect 的合成輪廓,其 bounds/area 與 NULL boundary 的 rect 路徑相同),索引消失會先在那裡失敗;被變異那行在現行語意(2026-09-18 反轉為重算)下永遠是 no-op。夾具 M56_grid_index_vanish(面縮到索引 7 消失)原始版與變異版輸出逐字相同。",
  "date": "2026-10-21",
  "source_file": "geometry-templates/woodworking/native/world_validation.c",
  "source_sha256": "3a5d05ffdf45a142326f17b2173bda7c7cd157d9c32d8ea6e71a93b275a3c2fc",
